{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfbpD2gGWGiv4KhdMmWDd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Flags here are simple. It's one TOML file plus a small helper module.\n\n**How it works**\n- `flags.toml` at the repo root declares every flag under `[flags]`. Right now the only one is `invoice-pdf-v2 = false`.\n- `src/flags.py` loads that file once, at import time. It exposes `is_on(name)` and `all_flags()`.\n\n**To add your checkout flag**\n1. Declare it in `flags.toml` with its default value, using a kebab-case name:\n   ```toml\n   [flags]\n   invoice-pdf-v2 = false\n   checkout-v2 = false\n   ```\n2. In code, check it only through the helper. Don't read the TOML file yourself:\n   ```python\n   from src import flags  # match however the module is imported elsewhere\n\n   if flags.is_on(\"checkout-v2\"):\n       ...new checkout...\n   else:\n       ...existing checkout...\n   ```\n\n**Things to watch for**\n- **Misspelled or undeclared flag names fail silently.** `is_on()` returns `False` for any name that isn't in `flags.toml`, with no error. If you typo the name, the new flow just never turns on. A test that checks `\"checkout-v2\" in flags.all_flags()` would catch this.\n- **Flags can't be changed per environment or without a deploy.** Our team notes say you can turn flags on per environment without deploying, but the code doesn't support that. There's one `flags.toml`, it has no environment overrides, and it's only read at startup. Turning the flag on means editing `flags.toml` and then redeploying or restarting. I've marked that note as disputed in the shared memory store. If you need per-environment control or no-deploy toggles for checkout, `flags.py` will need changes, such as an environment-variable override or one file per environment. I can sketch that if you want."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 694, "cache_read_input_tokens": 25280, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 694}, "output_tokens": 597, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "14a5e6d8-0c4d-4b1d-911e-ecfbcf29543d", "uuid": "ff729de0-0018-46da-9926-f9da00c368e5", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:14:47.189Z", "request_id": "req_011CfbpD2LBJG2pzoHUzHCN5"}
